{"framework":"vue","displayName":"Rows ▸ Row selection · Select rows with nested rows · Vue 3","tier":2,"engine":"container","sandpackTemplate":null,"sandpackEnvironment":null,"container":"vue","htWrappers":["@handsontable/vue3"],"entry":"/src/main.ts","htmlEntry":"/index.html","devCommand":"pnpm exec vite --host 0.0.0.0 --port 5173","buildCommand":"vite build","outputDir":"dist","outputGlob":null,"staticExport":false,"spaMode":false,"port":5173,"installCommand":"pnpm install","htCoreRange":"0.0.0-next-c49213f-20261020","fileCount":5,"assets":[],"skipped":[],"files":{"/package.json":"{\n  \"name\": \"handsontable-vue-example\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@10.34.5\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"handsontable\": \"0.0.0-next-c49213f-20261020\",\n    \"@handsontable/vue3\": \"0.0.0-next-c49213f-20261020\",\n    \"vue\": \"3.x\",\n    \"vite\": \"^5.4.0\",\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\"\n  }\n}","/vite.config.js":"import { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\nimport vue from \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({ plugins: [vue()], server: { allowedHosts: true } });","/index.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Handsontable Vue Example</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"example5\"></div>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.ts\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>","/src/main.ts":"import { createApp } from \"vue\";\nimport App from \"./App.vue\";\ncreateApp(App).mount(\"#example5\");","/src/App.vue":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { onMounted, ref, useTemplateRef } from 'vue';\nimport { HotTable } from '@handsontable/vue3';\nimport { registerAllModules } from 'handsontable/registry';\nimport type { GridSettings } from 'handsontable/settings';\n\nregisterAllModules();\n\ninterface CatalogRow {\n  name: string;\n  sku: string | null;\n  stock: number | null;\n  __children?: CatalogRow[];\n}\n\nconst data: CatalogRow[] = [\n  {\n    name: 'Electronics',\n    sku: null,\n    stock: null,\n    __children: [\n      {\n        name: 'Audio',\n        sku: null,\n        stock: null,\n        __children: [\n          { name: 'Wireless Headphones', sku: 'SKU-2001', stock: 34 },\n          { name: 'Bluetooth Speaker', sku: 'SKU-2002', stock: 12 },\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        name: 'Computer Accessories',\n        sku: null,\n        stock: null,\n        __children: [\n          { name: 'Wireless Mouse', sku: 'SKU-0093', stock: 120 },\n          { name: 'USB-C Charging Cable', sku: 'SKU-2208', stock: 310 },\n          { name: 'Laptop Stand', sku: 'SKU-3105', stock: 0 },\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    name: 'Home & Office',\n    sku: null,\n    stock: null,\n    __children: [\n      {\n        name: 'Furniture',\n        sku: null,\n        stock: null,\n        __children: [\n          { name: 'Ergonomic Office Chair', sku: 'SKU-1170', stock: 8 },\n          { name: 'Standing Desk', sku: 'SKU-1185', stock: 5 },\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        name: 'Lighting',\n        sku: null,\n        stock: null,\n        __children: [\n          { name: 'Desk Lamp', sku: 'SKU-1402', stock: 46 },\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    name: 'Drinkware',\n    sku: null,\n    stock: null,\n    __children: [\n      { name: 'Stainless Steel Water Bottle', sku: 'SKU-4821', stock: 75 },\n      { name: 'Aluminum Water Filter', sku: 'SKU-3341', stock: 22 },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n\nconst hotRef = useTemplateRef<InstanceType<typeof HotTable>>('hotRef');\n\nconst hotSettings = ref<GridSettings>({\n  licenseKey: 'non-commercial-and-evaluation',\n  data,\n  height: 'auto',\n  width: '100%',\n  stretchH: 'all',\n  colHeaders: ['Name', 'SKU', 'Stock'],\n  columns: [\n    { data: 'name' },\n    { data: 'sku' },\n    { data: 'stock', type: 'numeric' },\n  ],\n  // the collapse buttons live in the row headers\n  rowHeaders: true,\n  nestedRows: true,\n  // the default `groupSelects: 'descendants'`: a parent row selects every row under it,\n  // and shows a mixed state while only some of them are selected\n  rowSelection: true,\n  navigableHeaders: true,\n  autoWrapRow: true,\n  autoWrapCol: true,\n});\n\nonMounted(() => {\n  // preselect the Wireless Mouse and the Desk Lamp to show the mixed parents\n  hotRef.value?.hotInstance?.getPlugin('rowSelection').selectRows([5, 13]);\n});\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div id=\"example5\">\n    <HotTable ref=\"hotRef\" :settings=\"hotSettings\" />\n  </div>\n</template>"},"docsPath":"guides/rows/row-selection/vue/example5.vue","breadcrumb":["Rows","Row selection"],"guide":"guides/rows/row-selection/row-selection.md","guideTitle":"Row selection","exampleId":"example5","exampleTitle":"Select rows with nested rows","docPermalink":"/row-selection","lang":"Vue 3"}
